# Round 135, per direct programmer feedback: compiled .mo files are
# generated by mediaplayer3.bb's own do_compile() step (msgfmt against
# the committed po/<lang>.po sources) and must never be committed
# themselves -- only the .po sources belong in version control, and
# only under po/ at the repo root, never duplicated into
# src/resources/locale/ itself.
src/resources/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.mo

# A real mistake found and cleaned up once already (a stray upload
# left both compiled .mo files AND a second, stale copy of the .po
# sources sitting under src/resources/locale/ -- confirmed by diff
# against po/'s own current files that these were also out of date).
# Excluded here too as a defensive safety net against the same thing
# happening again, not because .po files are ever expected to be
# regenerated there the way .mo files are.
src/resources/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/*.po

# Standard Python build/runtime artifacts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
